Why must it take so long?

293
00:20:47,611 --> 00:20:50,614
因為這相當困難...
Because it is very difficult...

294
00:20:50,973 --> 00:20:53,867
...很多環節都可能出錯
...so much can go wrong.

295
00:21:05,927 --> 00:21:08,640
二十年的努力了
Twenty years of work.

296
00:21:08,850 --> 00:21:12,424
我們的計劃是不是已經準備好了？ 安靜...聽...
Our plan is ready now? -Quiet... listen...

297
00:21:13,845 --> 00:21:16,727
...他們過來了
...they are coming.

298
00:21:23,965 --> 00:21:27,829
你必須把這個藏起來 絕不能讓他們找到它
You must hide this. They must not find it.

299
00:21:28,289 --> 00:21:31,312
去開門並保持友好
Answer the door and be polite.

300
00:21:31,513 --> 00:21:33,915
不！你帶上它
No! You take it.

301
00:21:34,908 --> 00:21:38,074
你看，這就是問題所在了 這就是團伙的標誌
You see, this is the problem. This is the gang sign.

302
00:21:38,214 --> 00:21:40,853
你看到這沒？所以 看起來我們找到了
You see this? So again, looks like we have

303
00:21:40,954 --> 00:21:43,356
越來越多的幫派成員
more and more gang members.

304
00:21:43,457 --> 00:21:46,060
方德斯瓦，你先站在後面 你站在托馬斯後面
Fundiswa, you just stay back. You stay behind Thomas.

305
00:21:46,361 --> 00:21:49,765
這裡到處是MNU的人 肯定會被發現的
This place is swarming with MNU. I will be searched.

306
00:21:49,866 --> 00:21:53,870
我必須回到我孩子身邊 別惹他們生氣～禮貌點
I must get back to my son. Don't make them angry - be polite!

307
00:21:54,746 --> 00:21:57,549
MNU探員，請開門
MNU agents, open the door please.

308
00:21:57,651 --> 00:22:01,054
你好，我們想要你... 這裡沒人
Hello? We would like you to... -Nobody is here.

309
00:22:01,253 --> 00:22:04,749
不能這樣 那完全不可接受
Okay, that's unexceptable. That is totally unexceptable!

310
00:22:04,964 --> 00:22:07,934
滾出來！滾出來！ 你這只蠢蝦
Get out! Get out! You stupid prawn!

311
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:11,267
出來 來！走開，走開
-Get outside! -C'mon! Move! Move!

312
00:22:21,666 --> 00:22:24,527
跪著 我進去看一看
On your knees! -I'm gonna have a look.

313
00:22:24,642 --> 00:22:26,708
