Just stay there! Right there!

314
00:22:26,808 --> 00:22:29,709
先生，我是來給你發放驅逐通知的
Sir, we have to serve you an eviction notice.

315
00:22:29,810 --> 00:22:31,812
你不知道嗎？ 不知道
Do you understand it? -No.

316
00:22:31,919 --> 00:22:35,123
這是一個典型的幫派集會的場所 我可以看出來
This is a classic kind of gangsta shack, I can tell you.

317
00:22:35,224 --> 00:22:39,096
我們肯定能在這裡發現武器 小心你的頭，別碰到牛
We're gonna find weapons here. Watch your head, don't hit the cows.

318
00:22:39,432 --> 00:22:42,437
檢查那些控制板 啊，你聽到了嗎
Just checking for panels. Ah, you hear that?

319
00:22:42,606 --> 00:22:45,075
是的，裡面是空的
Yeah, it's hollow there.

320
00:22:45,946 --> 00:22:48,339
看，看那
See? Look at that!

321
00:22:48,685 --> 00:22:52,290
我還沒看過這樣的裝置 它看起來就像一個...
I haven't see this type of setup. It's almost like a...

322
00:22:52,559 --> 00:22:55,161
化學實驗裝備
chemistry type of a set.

323
00:22:55,663 --> 00:22:58,466
這裡一定有些什麼東西
It's gotta be something.

324
00:23:09,190 --> 00:23:12,830
我不確定，這裡有一些標誌
l don't know, this has got the markings there of...

325
00:23:13,030 --> 00:23:15,869
這毫無疑問是外星人留下的
...so it is definitely alien.

326
00:23:16,171 --> 00:23:19,774
但這不是武器 但我不相信它
But it's not a weapon. But I don't trust it.

327
00:23:22,879 --> 00:23:26,282
你沒事吧？ 維庫斯，你沒事吧？
Are you all right? Wikus, are you all right?

