Are you gonna cut that part out, Trent, where it sprays me?

330
00:23:38,595 --> 00:23:40,797
是的，別擔心 記得把那段剪掉
-Yeah, don't worry. -You cut that.

331
00:23:40,915 --> 00:23:44,219
我們剛在這裡發現了一個危險的東西
We just found a dangerous object here.

332
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:48,936
