requesting First Reaction Battalion.

343
00:24:23,956 --> 00:24:26,158
準備行動，夥計們
Stand by, guys!

344
00:24:26,844 --> 00:24:29,479
這種槍我從沒見過 你見過這個麼？
This gun I've never seen. Have you seen this?

345
00:24:29,581 --> 00:24:32,784
這真是太令人驚訝了！看看這槍 這是什麼槍
This is amazing! Look at this gun. What gun is this?

346
00:24:33,121 --> 00:24:35,123
這無疑非常令人驚訝
This is absolutely amazing!

347
00:24:35,224 --> 00:24:37,626
你在做什麼？ 我想把這個給托馬斯看
-What are you doing? -I wanna show this to Thomas.

348
00:24:37,727 --> 00:24:39,729
但我想你說你應付不了它
But I thought you said you can't handle it.

349
00:24:39,830 --> 00:24:41,832
不，我不是應付它 我只是展示它
No, I am not handling it, I'm just gonna show it.

350
00:24:41,934 --> 00:24:44,937
我不打算使用它 人類甚至不能使用
I'm not gonna use it, man. It doesn't even work with humans.

351
00:24:45,038 --> 00:24:47,440
托馬斯，看看這只槍
Thomas, look at this gun!

352
00:24:48,843 --> 00:24:52,446
- 那不是我的 - 你是個軍火商？ -不是
-That's not mine. -You're a dealer, eh? -No.

353
00:24:53,996 --> 00:24:56,600
你聽到了嗎？ 你看到發生的一切嗎？
You hear this, sir? You see what's happening?

354
00:24:56,700 --> 00:24:59,361
第一營，我的朋友 你們知道這意味著什麼
First Battalion, my friend. You know what that means?

