在刀槍面前，你跑不了
You don't run away from the chopper. -No, no...

362
00:25:45,133 --> 00:25:48,760
你以為你能跑到哪？ 你想惹毛我？
Where do you think you're going? You wanna piss me off?

363
00:25:56,986 --> 00:25:59,587
庫布斯呼叫基地
Koobus to base, come in!

364
00:26:00,290 --> 00:26:04,364
我們有兩個人受傷了 MNU警衛，MNU探員
I've got two people down. MNU guard, MNU agent.

365
00:26:05,565 --> 00:26:08,568
我是福克斯特勒特·楊基， 5-3-0，收到？
It's the Foxtrot Yankee 5-3-0... copy?

366
00:26:08,669 --> 00:26:11,372
我們需要醫護隊，盡快
And we need a Med Evac ASAP.

367
00:26:11,473 --> 00:26:14,376
不用，沒事，庫布斯 我並不需要醫護人員
No, that's fine, Koobus. I don't need a Med Evac.

368
00:26:14,489 --> 00:26:16,947
維庫斯，你的手燒傷了 你得...
Wikus, you burned your arm, you need to...

369
00:26:17,049 --> 00:26:20,052
我就在這裡治療就行了，庫布斯
I'll just treat it here, Koobus.

370
00:26:20,831 --> 00:26:24,438
先生，我真的認為你必須看看醫生 進醫生或者啥的
Sir, I really think you must go to a doctor, a hospital or something.

371
00:26:24,538 --> 00:26:27,004
不，不 你得去醫院檢查一下
-No, no. -You should just get it checked out.

372
00:26:27,114 --> 00:26:30,374
上點藥就好了 扶我起來
I'll just have it treated by the medics. Help me up.

373
00:26:30,819 --> 00:26:33,089
特雷特，你看到大蝦跑得有多快了嗎？
Did you see how fast that prawn was, Trent?

374
00:26:33,189 --> 00:26:36,259
是的，他相當的快 告訴你，他相當的快
-Yeah, he was fast. -He was fast, I promise you.

375
00:26:44,569 --> 00:26:47,572
看，我修好它了 它能工作了
Look, I fix it. I make it work.

376
