沒事，出去放風去
Nothing. Go outside and watch for humans.

379
00:26:57,485 --> 00:26:59,887
你的朋友呢？
Where is your friend?

380
00:27:00,189 --> 00:27:02,391
他死了
He's gone.

381
00:27:13,099 --> 00:27:15,730
你沒事吧？ 沒事，就是感覺有點熱
Are you okay? -Yeah, I'm just a bit hot.

382
00:27:15,831 --> 00:27:18,834
你們覺得熱嗎？ 你覺得熱嗎，特雷特？  不熱
Are you guys hot? Are you hot, Trent? -No.

383
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:22,843
是的，怕熱就別進廚房
Yeah, if you can't stand the heat get out of the kitchen.

384
00:27:24,856 --> 00:27:28,860
現在，你看看 到處都是小孩
Now you see. There's kids everywhere.

385
00:27:29,161 --> 00:27:32,064
這就是我的意思 這就是我們要擺脫他們的原因
This is what I mean. That's why we get rid of them.

386
00:27:32,165 --> 00:27:34,568
小傢伙 是的，這就是我們為什麼要讓他們墮胎
-The little ones. -Yeah, that's why we abort.

387
00:27:34,676 --> 00:27:38,282
讓我們乾脆一槍斃了他們 別，別，別，現在別開槍
Lets just shoot the little bastard. -No, no, don't shoot it now.

388
00:27:38,583 --> 00:27:40,985
MNU探員，出來！
MNU agents! Come out!

389
00:27:41,087 --> 00:27:43,726
你好，小傢伙 MNU為你帶來了糖果
Hello, little guy. MNU has sweets for you.

390
00:27:43,827 --> 00:27:46,524
去吧，吃你的糖果
There you go, eat your sweety.

391
00:27:46,632 --> 00:27:49,825
吃起來甜甜的 這個方法每一次都非常靈驗
You know, eaty sweety. Works like a charm every time.

392
00:27:50,526 --> 00:27:52,528
哦，去你媽的，死小孩
Oh fuck, man!

393
00:27:52,730 --> 00:27:56,133
你差點用棒棒糖把我的眼睛戳出來了
You almost poked my eye out with the fokkin' lollypop.

394
00:27:56,351 --> 00:27:58,984
死小孩，我盡量對你和氣了
I tried to be fokkin' nice to you, man!

395
00:27:59,122 --> 00:28:01,651
這是你們家的小畜生嗎
Is this your fokkin' little brat here?

396
00:28:01,752 --> 00:28:04,755
進去 對不起，對不起
Inside, go! I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

397
00:28:05,035 --> 00:28:07,496
管教一下他 托馬斯，讓他出來
Teach him some manners. Thomas, get him out.

398
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:10,812
出來！跪下，我早已受夠了你們的愚蠢的遊戲
Come! Get down! I've had enough of your stupid games.

399
00:28:11,012 --> 00:28:13,439
你們想要做什麼
What do you want?

400
00:28:14,041 --> 00:28:16,041
我們是MNU的工作人員 我知道
We're from MNU. -I know.

401
00:28:16,143 --> 00:28:19,146
我們要你在這個驅逐通知單上蓋個手印
We require your scrawl on this eviction notification.

402
00:28:19,247 --> 00:28:22,250
- 我為什麼要被驅逐？ - 是的，這是一個驅逐通知單
-Why am I being evicted? -Yes, it's an eviction notice.

403
00:28:22,368 --> 00:28:25,773
把你的手印按在底下 看到沒？你的名字在上面
Put your scrawl on the bottom. See? There's your name at the top.

404
00:28:25,874 --> 00:28:28,877
- 是的！-克裡斯多夫·約翰遜? - 所以在底部按上你的名字
-Yes! -Christopher Johnson? So, put your name in the bottom.

405
00:28:28,978 --> 00:28:31,381
這裡說你們必須24小時前通知我
It says you must give me 24 hours notice.

406
00:28:31,485 --> 00:28:34,652
你們將到另一個地方 一個專為你們而新建的更好的城市
You're going to another place. A nice new city built especially for prawns.

407
00:28:34,756 --> 00:28:37,731
- 一個很特別的地方 -而且我們還不向你們收費，明白嗎？
-A special place! -And we are not even going to charge you, okay?

408
00:28:37,832 --> 00:28:41,135
- 這不合法 - 簽字！   - 不！
This isn't legal. -Sign the fokkin' paper! -No!

409
00:28:43,138 --> 00:28:46,542
這個傢伙很明顯 他聰明點
This guy is obviously... he's a little sharper.

410
00:28:46,642 --> 00:28:49,645
所以我們要另想辦法
So we are gonna have to try something else.

411
00:28:49,855 --> 00:28:52,094
好的，你好...聽我說
All right. Hello... okay.

412
00:28:52,194 --> 00:28:55,599
看來我們有些地方沒有說明白，嗯
Seems like we didn't understand each other there properly, eh?

413
00:28:55,699 --> 00:28:58,071
在這裡你還有孩子
So, you've got a little one there.

414
00:28:58,172 --> 00:29:00,774
- 那小孩有辦出生證明嗎？ - 有的
Do you have a licence for that little one? -Yes.

415
