我要跟你的孩子談談
I'm gonna go and have a little chat with your son.

419
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:15,562
離我孩子遠點
You keep away from my child!

420
00:29:16,376 --> 00:29:18,841
別用那骯髒的觸手指著我
Don't point your fokkin' tentacles at me!

421
00:29:18,942 --> 00:29:20,944
你說你想呆在這？
You said you want to stay?

422
00:29:21,045 --> 00:29:23,848
你的孩子將要和我一起去福利院
Your boy is coming down with me to Child Services.

423
00:29:23,955 --> 00:29:26,992
他的下半輩子就只能在1×1米的箱子裡度過了
He's gonna spend the rest of his life in 1 by 1 meter box.

424
00:29:27,196 --> 00:29:30,824
你好，小傢伙，可愛的叔叔過來了
Hello, little guy! It's the sweety man coming!

425
00:29:31,525 --> 00:29:34,929
操，看看這個，特雷特！ 操他媽的！
Fuck, look at this, Trent! Fuck it!

426
00:29:35,677 --> 00:29:38,939
托馬斯，拿槍指著他 他是徹頭徹尾的罪犯
Thomas, keep the gun on him. He is definitely a criminal!

427
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:42,243
這裡簡直是個電腦商店
