01:11:50,558 --> 01:11:54,164
聽我說...我真不知道他們 在這裡幹什麼
Listen... I promise you, I didn't know they were doing this.

900
01:11:54,366 --> 01:11:57,204
直到他們上次也把我帶進來
Until they brought me here the other day,

901
01:11:57,304 --> 01:12:00,477
我向你發誓，我真的不知道 他們這樣對你們的人
I swear to you I did not know they were doing this to you guys.

902
01:12:00,677 --> 01:12:03,548
克裡斯多夫... 看著我，聽我說
But Christopher... look at me. Listen to me.

903
01:12:03,683 --> 01:12:06,455
我們現在得趕緊走了，好嗎？
We need to leave now. Okay?

904
01:12:06,555 --> 01:12:09,328
整個MNU的人都會下來的
The whole of MNU is gonna come down here.

905
01:12:09,428 --> 01:12:12,091
他們要我們的命的
He's going to destroy us.

906
01:12:13,705 --> 01:12:16,776
我們能辦到的，對嗎？ 我們趕緊離開這裡
We can do this, okay? We're gonna get out of here...

907
01:12:17,176 --> 01:12:18,868
開火！
Fire!

908
01:12:19,769 --> 01:12:21,771
快點，快點
Move, move!

909
01:12:23,274 --> 01:12:25,877
朝大蝦開火
Shoot at the prawn!

910
01:12:35,077 --> 01:12:38,179
克裡斯多夫!你他媽在幹啥？
Christopher! What the fuck are you doing?

911
01:12:45,787 --> 01:12:48,790
想想你的孩子
Think of your boy, for fuck sake!

912
01:12:57,457 --> 01:13:01,460
你究竟在幹啥？ 你瘋了嗎？
What the hell are you doing? Are you out of your fuckin' mind?

913
01:13:03,734 --> 01:13:07,333
你會讓我們都死掉了的 我們現在該怎麼辦？
You're gonna get us killed! -What do we do now?

914
01:13:10,180 --> 01:13:12,876
我以為你知道出路呢？
I thought you had a way out?

915
01:13:12,986 --> 01:13:15,390
我從來沒有提到出路
I didn't say anything about the way out.

916
01:13:15,490 --> 01:13:18,751
我答應過你我們一定能進去 我們的確進來了   -我想到了
-I promised you that we'll get in. We're in! -I have an idea.

917
01:13:18,853 --> 01:13:21,856
你去哪？ 跟著我就是
-Where are you going? -Follow me!

918
01:13:26,348 --> 01:13:29,649
你在做什麼？ 做炸彈
What are you doing? -Making a bomb.

919
01:13:29,849 --> 01:13:31,851
走吧
Let's go!

920
01:13:44,263 --> 01:13:46,866
快點，進來！
Quick! Get in!

921
01:13:47,868 --> 01:13:49,870
走！開車！
Go! Drive!

922
01:13:50,672 --> 01:13:52,473
好的！
Okay!

923
01:13:54,374 --> 01:13:56,577
好的，坐穩了
Okay, hold on!

924
01:13:57,679 --> 01:13:59,481
操！
Fuck!

925
01:14:05,054 --> 01:14:08,752
報道來自約翰內斯堡市中心的一個爆炸
Reports are coming in of explosion in downtown Johannesburg.

926
01:14:08,954 --> 01:14:11,356
那裡遭到了一次恐怖襲擊
Well, there was a terrorist attack,

927
01:14:11,457 --> 01:14:14,861
不過我向你們保證，我們正在處理這事 一切都很正常
but I can assure you that we dealt with it. Everything is fine.

928
01:14:17,364 --> 01:14:20,567
飛低點 飛低點，下降
Droop it down! Droop it down! Decline!

929
01:14:29,134 --> 01:14:31,935
他們裡我們 很近了
They are really close to us now!

930
01:14:35,339 --> 01:14:37,141
糟糕
Shit!

931
01:14:41,758 --> 01:14:43,919
走，快走
Let's go, let's go!

932
01:14:45,533 --> 01:14:48,298
別把那他媽的流體弄丟了
Don't drop that fokkin' thing!

933
01:14:56,656 --> 01:14:59,259
快點，快，下來
Come on, move! Get down there!

934
01:14:59,360 --> 01:15:02,764
下去並輸入啟動命令
Go down and initiate the binary commands.

935
01:15:05,072 --> 01:15:07,543
趕緊降落
Set it down right now!

936
01:15:07,777 --> 01:15:10,839
我們到達主船時，還要多久才能治好
When we get up to the mothership, how long is this gonna take?

937
01:15:10,941 --> 01:15:13,543
把什麼治好？ 治我的病呀
-To do what? -The fixing. To fix me.

938
01:15:13,644 --> 01:15:16,447
可能要比我想的費時一些
It's going to take a bit longer than I thought.

939
01:15:16,554 --> 01:15:18,753
好的，得需要多久
Okay, that's fine. How long do you need?

940
01:15:18,854 --> 01:15:21,056
3年
Three years.

941
01:15:21,436 --> 01:15:24,008
對不起，能說清楚點嗎
Sorry, just go slowly with the clicks there,

942
01:15:24,109 --> 01:15:27,449
你說的「3年」聽起來想是地球上的3年
it sounded like you said "three years", like human years.

943
01:15:27,649 --> 01:15:30,287
是的，三年
Yes. Three years.

944
01:15:30,822 --> 01:15:33,315
什麼？他媽的3年？
What? Three fuckin' years?

945
01:15:33,416 --> 01:15:36,219
我會治好你的
I will fix you,

946
01:15:36,420 --> 01:15:39,523
但首先我得拯救我的同伴
but first I must save my people.

947
01:15:39,906 --> 01:15:43,044
我們的約定是：你能回家 我也能把病治好
The deal was: you go home, I get fixed!

948
01:15:43,145 --> 01:15:46,949
我不會讓我的同胞淪為醫學實驗品的
I will not let my people be medical experiments!

949
01:15:47,354 --> 01:15:50,158
我就是他媽的一個醫學實驗品 聽到我說的了嗎？ 克裡斯多夫？
I'm a fokkin' medical experiment! You hear me, Christopher?

950
01:15:50,259 --> 01:15:52,762
我就是他媽的一個醫學實驗品
I'm a fokkin' medical experiment, man!

951
01:15:52,863 --> 01:15:55,666
我必須回家並搬些救兵過來
I must go home and get help.

952
01:15:55,767 --> 01:15:58,969
我必須用盡所有的流體 才能迅速飛回去
I must use all the fluid to travel quickly.

953
01:16:00,112 --> 01:16:04,119
那我就得呆在這個爛地方了，克裡斯多夫？ 我就得呆在這個鬼地方了
I'll just stay here, Christopher? I'll just stay here in this shack.

954
01:16:04,520 --> 01:16:08,182
- 3年後我才能見到你？ - 我答應你，我會回來的
And I'll see you in three years time? -I will come back. I promise.

955
01:16:08,361 --> 01:16:10,286
克裡斯多夫！
Christopher!

956
01:16:32,307 --> 01:16:34,710
他媽的去哪了？
Where the fuck is he?

957
01:16:35,512 --> 01:16:39,314
嘿，你把維庫斯藏在下面了？
Hey, you're hiding Wikus down there, my boy?

958
01:16:40,417 --> 01:16:43,019
- 爸爸？ - 不，不要
-Father? -No, no, no.

959
01:16:43,321 --> 01:16:47,124
你父親得呆在這裡把一些事情處理好
Your daddy needs to stay here to sort out a few things, alright?

960
01:16:47,436 --> 01:16:51,240
我們得走了，不過我們會回來接他，好嗎？
We're gonna go. We're gonna come back and fetch him, okay?

961
01:16:54,686 --> 01:16:57,522
放在這裡？放進去 放進去？
In here? -In there. -Goes in here?

962
01:16:57,958 --> 01:17:00,925
你們是怎麼打開這玩意的，大蝦？
How the fuck do you open this, prawn?

963
01:17:03,671 --> 01:17:05,473
爸爸
Father.

964
01:17:06,275 --> 01:17:09,745
告訴我怎麼弄，你這個混蛋 你是不是想讓我弄死你？
Show me, you fucker. You want me to fuckin' kill you?

965
01:17:09,946 --> 01:17:12,949
這就是你想要的麼，阿？
Is that what you fuckin' want, eh?

966
01:17:29,057 --> 01:17:31,659
好了...這裡沒有按鈕
Right... there's no buttons.

967
01:17:31,961 --> 01:17:33,562
開機
On!

968
01:17:33,964 --> 01:17:35,766
激活？
Activate?

969
01:17:35,966 --> 01:17:38,437
我老師只教過我
My teachers teach only:

970
01:17:38,537 --> 01:17:41,069
一個大蝦，一顆子彈
One prawn, one bullet.

971
01:17:46,486 --> 01:17:49,585
難以置信，我拿錢就是幹這事的
I can't believe I get paid to do this.

972
01:17:50,794 --> 01:17:53,829
我愛看著你們大蝦死去
I love watching you prawns die.

973
01:17:56,532 --> 01:17:58,534
我操
Fuck, man!

974
01:18:07,765 --> 01:18:09,767
爸爸
Father!

975
01:18:13,973 --> 01:18:15,974
出去！出去
Get out! Get out!

976
01:18:23,091 --> 01:18:25,162
這簡直太奇異了
This is remarkable.

977
01:18:25,263 --> 01:18:28,266
看起來有什麼東西正從地下升起
It looks like something is emerging from the ground.

978
01:18:28,377 --> 01:18:31,427
肯定有什麼東西正從地面升起來
Something is definitely coming out of the ground.

979
01:18:31,828 --> 01:18:33,830
好了...穩點
Okay... steady!

980
01:18:41,359 --> 01:18:44,031
坐下，我沒空搭理你了
Go sit down, I can't play with ya now.

981
01:18:44,131 --> 01:18:46,901
維庫斯叔叔正在開飛船
Uncle Wikus is flying.

982
01:18:47,773 --> 01:18:50,342
一邊去，一邊去
Bug off. Bug off!

983
01:18:56,524 --> 01:18:59,326
武器鎖定目標
Lock the weapon at target!

984
01:18:59,495 --> 01:19:02,097
鎖定後開火
Fire when locked.

985
01:19:04,539 --> 01:19:07,873
看起來飛船正朝領土的中央開去
It seems to be drifting towards the center of the territory.

986
01:19:08,045 --> 01:19:10,709
我們已經鎖定他了 開火
We have a lock on him. -Fire!

987
01:19:11,385 --> 01:19:14,713
導彈已經發射出去了... 導彈打中了飛船
Something is fired upon... it has been hit!

988
01:19:15,226 --> 01:19:17,229
這是怎麼回事
What the fuck is that?

989
01:19:17,329 --> 01:19:20,136
有一個引擎已經開始冒煙 飛船開始失去控制了
One of the engines is billowing smoke, it's out of control.

990
01:19:20,436 --> 01:19:24,070
它墮落下來了，頭 要不要我叫些兄弟去幹死他們
It's going down, boss. Should I send the boys to fuck him up?

991
01:19:27,984 --> 01:19:31,388
現在，飛船已經撞到了地上 重重一撞
Now... it hit the ground, the massive impact,

992
01:19:31,489 --> 01:19:34,492
飛船已經停下來了
and it's come to a standstill.

993
01:19:39,609 --> 01:19:42,612
我的兒子 我的兒子還在上面
My son! My son's in there!

994
01:19:42,814 --> 01:19:45,684
閉嘴 把他帶進去
Shut the fuck up! Get this fucker inside.

995
01:19:45,786 --> 01:19:49,081
我們出發了 快，快走
We're moving out. Come, let's go, let's go...

996
01:19:49,859 --> 01:19:51,491
快走
Move!

997
01:19:51,763 --> 01:19:55,370
我們正在向目標靠近 以拍到更清晰的飛船畫面
We're banking around now, trying to get a better view of the ship

998
01:19:55,471 --> 01:19:59,275
飛船已經完全撞毀了 等著濃煙被清理掉
which is absolutely wrecked, waiting for some of the smoke to clear.

999
01:21:02,001 --> 01:21:04,808
有個人被從飛船上帶了下來
Somebody has been brought out of the vehicle.

1000
01:21:04,909 --> 01:21:07,110
看起來像是個人類
It looks like a human being.

1001
01:21:07,211 --> 01:21:09,983
我們得到一個未經證實的 消息說他可能是
We are getting unconfirmed reports that this might be

1002
01:21:10,084 --> 01:21:12,990
維庫斯·范德默爾，是MNU的一個
Wikus Van De Merwe, a fugitive that has been on the run

1003
01:21:13,091 --> 01:21:15,494
潛逃了三天的犯人
from MNU for the past 3 days.

1004
01:21:15,595 --> 01:21:19,356
他們把他押上了車，並開走了
They are loading him into a vehicle now, and heading off.

1005
01:21:22,260 --> 01:21:25,263
暴露72小時後
72 HOURS AFTER EXPOSURE

1006
01:21:46,458 --> 01:21:48,887
怎麼回事？
What the fuck?

1007
01:22:01,617 --> 01:22:05,045
我們抓到他了，頭 把他帶過來
We caught him, boss. -Bring him to me.

1008
01:22:21,689 --> 01:22:23,983
過來！回去
Come on! Get back!

1009
01:22:25,497 --> 01:22:27,390
我操！
Oh, fuck!

1010
01:22:33,112 --> 01:22:37,412
總部，我方與敵方交火，需要援助 需要援助，快點
Control, we're taking enemy fire! We need support. Backup, now!

1011
01:22:42,697 --> 01:22:45,225
出來，出來
Fuck off! Fuck off, man!

1012
01:22:55,436 --> 01:22:58,640
把手拿開 媽的，離我遠點
Get you hands off me! Fuckin' get off me!

1013
01:23:02,244 --> 01:23:05,047
放開我
Get your fuckin' hands off me!

1014
01:23:41,980 --> 01:23:45,385
我難道沒有告訴過你... 我會回來找你的？
Didn't I tell you... that I'm gonna get you?

1015
01:23:45,719 --> 01:23:49,557
你到這裡，然後你拿著 本屬於我的東西走了
You came in here and you left with something that belongs to me.

1016
01:23:50,997 --> 01:23:53,162
去你媽的
Fuck you.

1017
01:24:00,516 --> 01:24:03,051
去你祖宗十八代
Fuck you all!

1018
01:24:42,465 --> 01:24:45,470
我告訴過你這一天會到來的
I told you that the day will come.

1019
01:24:46,171 --> 01:24:49,443
你卻帶著我的戰利品跑了
You've been running around with my prize.

1020
01:24:50,012 --> 01:24:53,651
我就想吃了你的手 變得和你一樣
All I want is to eat that hand and become like you.

1021
01:24:54,087 --> 01:24:56,549
不！吃我的手不管用...
No! It won't work...

1022
01:25:00,232 --> 01:25:03,673
一旦我擁有了那種力量 就沒人能夠阻止我
Once I have that power, no one will stop me.

1023
01:25:03,974 --> 01:25:07,377
風水輪流轉...現在到我了
It was your turn... now it's mine!

1024
01:25:10,485 --> 01:25:14,092
和MNU安全部隊對著干 這些武裝分子死定了
Fighting MNU security forces, this armed faction is doomed...

1025
01:25:19,039 --> 01:25:22,671
現在我要開吃了，我的朋友
Now I'm gonna eat, my friend.

1026
01:26:45,752 --> 01:26:49,955
我們剛得到消息說 外星設備已經被啟動了
We're getting reports claiming that the alien device is activating...

1027
01:27:49,697 --> 01:27:53,403
你看到那個在車裡的大蝦了，是嗎？
You see that prawn back in the Casper? -Yeah.

1028
01:27:53,670 --> 01:27:56,743
他對飛船的構造很瞭解
He knows what the fuck is up with that ship.

1029
01:27:56,843 --> 01:28:00,508
抓他出來，並使他開口 套出東西出來
Get that fucker out and get him talking, now.

1030
01:28:12,242 --> 01:28:16,112
三方部隊正在靠近尼日利亞據點
Three contractors are closing in on the nigerian compound, and...

1031
01:28:18,451 --> 01:28:21,019
過來，外星人
Come, alien!

1032
01:28:31,479 --> 01:28:34,078
你有什麼陰謀
What's your plan?

1033
01:28:57,395 --> 01:28:59,965
你們怎麼弄到的？
How are you doing it?

1034
01:29:00,134 --> 01:29:02,701
誰在開那個飛船
Who's moving that ship?

1035
01:29:04,203 --> 01:29:06,605
好，這相當聰明
All right, that's very clever.

1036
01:29:11,858 --> 01:29:15,796
等我命令 確保一槍斃命
Wait for my command. Make sure you fuckin' shoot to kill.

1037
01:29:22,881 --> 01:29:25,284
操！快走！快走！
Fuck! Move it! Move it!

1038
01:29:26,886 --> 01:29:29,520
把那東西幹掉
Bring that fucker down!

1039
01:29:36,242 --> 01:29:39,746
停火！停火！ 原地別動
Hold you fire! Hold your fire and keep your positions!

1040
01:29:40,045 --> 01:29:42,371
他是范德默爾
It's Van De Merwe.

1041
01:29:42,873 --> 01:29:45,075
嘿，混蛋
Hey, Dickus!

1042
01:29:59,283 --> 01:30:02,288
我回來救那外星人的 是嗎？
I'll come back for prawn, alright guys?

1043
01:30:02,389 --> 01:30:04,592
聽到沒？ 快跑呀，維庫斯
Do you hear me, now? -Run, Wikus!

1044
01:30:04,693 --> 01:30:06,934
聽到我說的沒？ 快跑呀
-You hear me? -Run!

1045
01:30:07,035 --> 01:30:09,837
繼續跑呀 你這個膽小鬼
And keep on running, you fuckin' coward!

1046
01:30:09,939 --> 01:30:12,105
快跑，快跑
Run! Run!

1047
01:30:14,546 --> 01:30:18,385
請求空中支援 跟蹤他
Get the air support up, and get on his fuckin' trail, now!

1048
01:30:21,359 --> 01:30:24,797
不起作用，頭 他嘴硬得很
It's not gonna work, boss. He's a tough one.

1049
01:30:24,967 --> 01:30:28,398
他根本不透露任何消息 那直接斃了他
He's not gonna talk. -Then just fuckin' kill him.

1050
01:30:42,913 --> 01:30:45,716
他根本不透露任何消息 那直接斃了他
<i>He's not gonna talk. -Then just fuckin' kill him.</i>

1051
01:30:45,817 --> 01:30:47,419
操
Fuck!

1052
01:30:47,519 --> 01:30:50,020
他嘴很硬 不肯透露消息
<i>He's a tough one. He's not gonna talk.</i>

1053
01:30:50,121 --> 01:30:52,324
那就直接斃了他
<i>Then just fuckin' kill him.</i>

1054
01:31:15,358 --> 01:31:18,862
嘿，過來，起來 我要帶你離開這
Hey, c'mon. Get up! I'm gonna get you out of here.

1055
01:31:19,023 --> 01:31:22,565
我不行了...太遠了 不遠，快起來
-I can't... it's too far. -It's not too fokkin' far. Get up!

1056
01:31:22,967 --> 01:31:26,369
我會帶你過去 我要把你帶到你兒子身邊
I'm gonna get you there. I'm gonna get you to your boy!

1057
01:31:26,470 --> 01:31:28,972
來吧，跟我我身後
C'mon, stay behind me!

1058
01:31:39,883 --> 01:31:42,084
後退
Go back!

1059
01:31:45,788 --> 01:31:47,790
快跑，快跑，快跑
Run, run, run!

1060
01:31:52,694 --> 01:31:56,498
現在到達目地的了 我們得清除障礙
Arriving at the location now. We have a clearance to engage.

1061
01:31:57,099 --> 01:32:00,102
外星人過來了 趴下，趴下
Prawns are coming, get down, get down!

1062
01:32:15,716 --> 01:32:19,320
他們在朝降落點過去了 殺了這些混蛋
There are headed for a drop site. Knock these fuckers off!

1063
01:32:21,922 --> 01:32:24,124
來吧，來吧...
Come to mommy, come...

1064
01:32:27,627 --> 01:32:29,429
操
Fuck!

1065
01:32:34,935 --> 01:32:36,736
糟糕
Shit!

1066
01:32:37,947 --> 01:32:40,009
你受傷了？
Are you hurt?

1067
01:32:40,610 --> 01:32:43,413
我們可以做到 我手臂中彈了
We can make it. I was shot in the arm.

1068
01:32:43,514 --> 01:32:45,616
我們可以做到 快點
We can make it, come on!

1069
01:33:02,131 --> 01:33:05,134
聽著，你直走 你可以做到的
Listen, you go ahead. You can make it.

1070
01:33:05,234 --> 01:33:09,036
我來拖住他們 我待會再和你會合
I'm gonna just... hold them off here, and I'll join you soon.

1071
01:33:09,197 --> 01:33:12,931
不，我們要並肩作戰 我不會丟下你的
No, we stick together. I'm not leaving you here.

1072
01:33:13,231 --> 01:33:16,234
帶著你的孩子回家 你得做到
Take your boy and go home. You have to make it.

1073
01:33:16,335 --> 01:33:19,237
別讓我的辛苦白費了
Don't make me go through all of this and not make it.

1074
01:33:19,338 --> 01:33:22,610
你明白嗎？ 我會回來找你的
Do you understand? -I will come back for you.

1075
01:33:22,812 --> 01:33:25,914
趕緊！在我改變主意前 快走
Go! Go now before I change my mind! Go!

1076
01:33:26,364 --> 01:33:29,126
3年，我答應過你
Three years. I promise.

1077
01:33:54,551 --> 01:33:57,354
我他媽一點都不怕你們
I'm not fuckin' scared of you!

1078
01:34:04,762 --> 01:34:07,164
朝我開槍呀
Quit fuckin' with me!

1079
01:34:53,007 --> 01:34:55,409
想抓住我？ 想抓住我？
You want me? You want me?

1080
01:35:00,313 --> 01:35:02,515
這就是你那點本事嗎？
Is that all you got?

1081
01:35:03,916 --> 01:35:06,519
你他媽就那點本事嗎？
Is that all you fuckin' got?

1082
01:35:08,921 --> 01:35:12,725
從主飛船上發來一束 強烈的光線
Some kind of quite extraordinary light from the mothership.

1083
01:35:12,925 --> 01:35:16,128
我從來沒有見過任何類似的東西 它像一道光束
I've never seen anything like it. It's a beam of light...

1084
01:35:23,536 --> 01:35:26,338
全面掃瞄，好的
Full scan. Okay.

1085
01:35:29,942 --> 01:35:31,744
開火
Fire!

1086
01:36:03,173 --> 01:36:06,977
- 把那車開過來，快點 - 好的，上校   -快點快點
-Get to the vehicle, now! Get going. -Yes colonel. -Go, go, go!

1087
01:36:31,400 --> 01:36:33,202
操
Fuck!

1088
01:36:34,103 --> 01:36:36,806
不敢和我玩了，Koobus！
Quit playing with me, Koobus!

1089
01:36:37,106 --> 01:36:39,308
你這個混蛋
You fucker!

1090
01:36:58,425 --> 01:37:01,028
快走，克裡斯，走
Go, Chris, go.

1091
01:37:01,629 --> 01:37:03,832
回家
Go home.

1092
01:38:39,733 --> 01:38:42,536
我們現在回家了？
We go home now?

1093
01:38:42,816 --> 01:38:44,627
是的
Yes.

1094
01:38:52,054 --> 01:38:55,649
暴露74小時後
74 HOURS AFTER EXPOSURE

1095
01:39:10,562 --> 01:39:12,564
簡直難以置信
Unbelievable.

1096
01:39:13,364 --> 01:39:16,568
現在我知道為什麼人人都 想分一杯羹了
Now I know why everybody wants a piece of you.

1097
01:39:19,671 --> 01:39:22,874
我都迫不及待想讓醫生 解剖你了
I can't wait for those med boys to cut you up.

1098
01:39:22,974 --> 01:39:25,176
但你知道嘛？
But you know what?

1099
01:39:25,276 --> 01:39:28,279
我不會再讓你浪費我的一分一秒了
You're not gonna waste any more of my time.

1100
01:39:28,380 --> 01:39:30,982
你這個半獸人
You half-breed piece of shit!

1101
01:39:32,784 --> 01:39:35,987
我要親手宰了你
I'm gonna just fuckin' kill you myself.

1102
01:39:44,294 --> 01:39:47,698
退後，你他媽的 退後
Stay back, you fuck! Stay back!

1103
01:39:49,800 --> 01:39:51,802
退後
Stay back!

1104
01:41:17,373 --> 01:41:20,447
約翰內斯堡的所有人
The people everywhere across Johannesburg

1105
01:41:20,548 --> 01:41:23,787
都衝出了辦公室，涌向街頭
are flooding the streets and pouring out of their offices

1106
01:41:23,890 --> 01:41:28,095
所有的眼睛都在注視著這個重大的場面
and all eyes are pointed up towards the sky on this momentous day.

1107
01:41:28,196 --> 01:41:31,800
這是20年來，飛船首次
It's the first time, ladies and gentlemen, in over two decades,

1108
01:41:31,902 --> 01:41:35,104
向大家展示移動的痕跡
that the mothership has shown any sign of movement,

1109
01:41:35,205 --> 01:41:38,007
人群極度沸騰
and people are tremendously excited.

1110
01:41:38,108 --> 01:41:41,311
整座城市都凝固了
The city had come to an absolute standstill.

1111
01:41:41,412 --> 01:41:44,816
大家都想知道接下來會發生什麼
Everybody wants to know what's going to happen next.

1112
01:41:45,189 --> 01:41:48,612
究竟 克裡斯多夫·約翰遜會不會回來 已經無從考證了
There's no way of knowing whether or not Christopher Johnson will return.

1113
01:41:48,712 --> 01:41:50,915
不知道他是不是逃亡了
We don't know if he was simply escaping,

1114
01:41:51,026 --> 01:41:53,617
或者他在實施一個營救計劃
whether he will effect a rescue plan...

1115
01:41:55,220 --> 01:41:57,821
或者，會不會像媒體所言
...and, as the so called free press says,

1116
01:41:57,923 --> 01:42:00,926
會不會回來，向我們宣戰
whether or not he will come back and declare a war on us.

1117
01:42:26,550 --> 01:42:30,453
這是維庫斯·范德默爾 最後的影像記錄
This is the last known footage of Wikus Van De Merwe.

1118
01:42:30,955 --> 01:42:35,557
他究竟發生了什麼 我們只能猜測了
And we can only speculate as to what has happened to him.

1119
01:42:36,358 --> 01:42:39,962
一種陰謀論的理論是這樣解釋的
The more zany conspiracy theories state that

1120
01:42:40,162 --> 01:42:43,765
他已經被MNU或他國政府
he's been captured by MNU or by another government.

1121
01:42:43,966 --> 01:42:46,969
或者是政府特工逮捕了
Or by perhaps some shady government agency

1122
01:42:47,070 --> 01:42:49,972
已經被囚禁了起來
and he's actually being held in captivity.

1123
01:42:50,073 --> 01:42:52,975
如果我們知道他在哪裡？ 我們會試圖幫助他
If we knew where he was, we would try and help him,

1124
01:42:53,075 --> 01:42:56,277
而這才是難點所在，我們不知道 他身處何方
and that is the most difficult part, not knowing where he is.

1125
01:42:56,577 --> 01:43:00,781
維庫斯，很不幸的是，已經離開了 把所有的問題
Wikus, sadly, is gone but I'm the one who stays behind

1126
01:43:00,882 --> 01:43:04,686
留給了我一個人 而我卻無法回答
with all the questions. I can't give the answers.

1127
01:43:05,186 --> 01:43:09,190
在我心裡，他早已去了 僅此而已
He died in my mind a long time ago. And that's that.

1128
01:43:09,690 --> 01:43:13,694
維庫斯·范德默爾這個名字已經 是家喻戶曉了
Wikus Van Der Merwe is a name that will become very widely known

1129
01:43:13,794 --> 01:43:17,798
因為他在整個事件中 扮演了關鍵的角色
because of this pivotal role that he played in this whole event.

1130
01:43:17,999 --> 01:43:21,602
他是一個誠實的人 他不應該承受這一切
He was an honest man, and he didn't deserve any of what happened to him.

1131
01:43:21,702 --> 01:43:25,106
我是說，我進入了一個電腦系統 並發現了一些事實
I mean, I know. I looked into a computer system and I found stuff.

1132
01:43:25,216 --> 01:43:28,508
我的意思是所有的數據 都在裡面
I mean, the whole data was there, you know?

1133
01:43:28,609 --> 01:43:31,711
他們連藏都 沒藏好這些數據
They didn't even do a good job of hiding it.

1134
01:43:32,112 --> 01:43:35,314
方德斯瓦·莫拉嘎正在候審
<i>Fundiswa Mhlanga is currently awaiting trial</i>

1135
01:43:35,415 --> 01:43:38,618
由於曝光了MNU的非法基因研究項目
<i>for exposing MNU's illegal genetic research program.</i>

1136
01:43:39,017 --> 01:43:41,901
在外星人重安居計劃完成後
<i>District 9 was demolished</i>

1137
01:43:42,002 --> 01:43:45,205
第九區已經被拆毀了
<i>after the alien resettlement operation was completed.</i>

1138
01:43:45,324 --> 01:43:48,607
第十區現在容納有250萬外星人 而且數目仍在增長...
<i>District 10 now houses 2.5 million aliens and continues to grow...</i>

1139
01:43:49,308 --> 01:43:53,112
你們還沒見過我老婆的照片吧 給你們看看吧
You guys haven't seen a picture of my wife. Let me show you my wife.

1140
01:43:53,512 --> 01:43:55,714
她是我的天使
She's my special angel.

1141
01:43:55,814 --> 01:43:58,817
穿上婚紗，她看起來簡直就像是天使 你們想看看嗎？
She even looks like an angel with veil, you want to see that?

1142
01:43:58,918 --> 01:44:01,720
看，白色的婚紗...
Look, you see, with the white veil over the...

1143
01:44:01,820 --> 01:44:05,624
她看起來就像是天使 所有人都說我的老婆是天使
she even looks like an angel. Everyone says that his wife is angel,

1144
01:44:05,724 --> 01:44:08,927
這就是你透過鏡頭看到的 真正的天使
but this is a real angel that you see there, on the cameras.

1145
01:44:09,027 --> 01:44:12,230
他們不會把這個也播出去吧 應該不會
They won't put that in the video, I don't think.

1146
01:44:16,934 --> 01:44:19,536
我在門前發現了這個
I found this at my front door.

1147
01:44:19,637 --> 01:44:22,440
一定是某個人留下的
As tho somebody had just left it there.

1148
01:44:23,840 --> 01:44:26,643
我的朋友們說 我應該把這個扔掉
My friends say that I should throw it away,

1149
01:44:26,744 --> 01:44:29,147
因為它只是一片廢物
cause it's just a piece of rubbish.

1150
01:44:29,646 --> 01:44:32,649
可能是他送給我的 這好像很荒謬
That it couldn't possibly come from him.

1151
01:44:33,850 --> 01:44:36,253
但我相信這是真的
I know it's true.

1152
01:44:52,070 --> 01:44:55,072

